c7KRhw9","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T19:01:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T20:24:10Z","body":"I believe the fixes did not adequately resolve this issue for several reasons:\n1. Fields were not fixed, so if you replace the properties in your MRP with fields, the same error occurs (remove `{ get; set; }` and view the error). This happens since the new `IsStaticallyResolvable` method is only called for properties but not for fields.\n2. Simple arithmetic expressions, for example `2 * Mathf.Pi`, are evaluated as `default` (0) instead of ~6.283. See issue: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111370\n3. Evaluating unsupported expressions as `default` (0 or null) is not a clear way to indicate that the expression is not supported.\n\n~~I think the best way to resolve these issues would be one of the following:~~\n~~1. Revert these fixes and keep the old behaviour.\n2. Add more supported expressions to `IsStaticallyResolvable` and raise a compile error rather than falling back to `default` (0 or null).~~\n\nEdit: See fix in #111523.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393592381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]